{"id":"82293682c9179b16","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-dense-linear-order.md","title":"Dense Linear Orders without Endpoints","display":"df-dense-linear-order — Dense Linear Orders without Endpoints","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-dense-linear-order","aliases":["17-df-dense-linear-order"],"display":"df-dense-linear-order — Dense Linear Orders without Endpoints","label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"1.4","source_pages_print":[37,38],"source_pages_djvu":[53,54],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local formulation","source_result":"Example 1.4.1, strict-order variant","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-symbols]]","[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[17-df-term]]"],"local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-dense-linear-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-dense-linear-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dense-linear-order — Dense Linear Orders without Endpoints"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>37</span><span>38</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local formulation"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Example 1.4.1, strict-order variant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=(2,0)\">\\(r=(2,0)\\)</span> 为二元关系符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> 是符号族的指标；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{&lt;}\">\\(L_{&lt;}\\)</span> 定义后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L_{&lt;}}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L_{&lt;}}\\)</span> 是次序原子式的两个项输入，项的定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c40994941c97c4da\" href=\"?note=c40994941c97c4da\" title=\"17-df-term\">17-df-term</a>。显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t&lt;u\">\\(t&lt;u\\)</span> 的展开式在 Assertion 给出。固定变量及逻辑符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V,\\mathsf G\">\\(\\mathsf V,\\mathsf G\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"058f3c1c00535492\" href=\"?note=058f3c1c00535492\" title=\"17-df-symbol-alphabet\">17-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{&lt;}\">\\(L_{&lt;}\\)</span> 是只有一个二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>、无函数和常元的语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2\">\\(x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2\\)</span> 是三个固定语言变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 是对象语言符号，以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\">\\(T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\\)</span> 是句子集。其余连接词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nF_n&amp;:=\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\qquad\nR_n:=\\begin{cases}\\{r\\},&amp;n=2,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;n\\neq2,\\end{cases}\\quad(n\\in\\omega)\\\\\nL_{&lt;}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf V,\\varnothing,(F_n)_{n\\in\\omega},(R_n)_{n\\in\\omega},\\mathsf G\\rangle,\\\\\n(t&lt;u)&amp;:=r(t,u).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nF_n&amp;:=\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\qquad\nR_n:=\\begin{cases}\\{r\\},&amp;n=2,\\\\\\varnothing,&amp;n\\neq2,\\end{cases}\\quad(n\\in\\omega)\\\\\nL_{&lt;}&amp;:=\\langle\\mathsf V,\\varnothing,(F_n)_{n\\in\\omega},(R_n)_{n\\in\\omega},\\mathsf G\\rangle,\\\\\n(t&lt;u)&amp;:=r(t,u).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\forall x\\,\\neg(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\,((\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z))\\to \\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(x)=\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\to\\exists z\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(z)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y))),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\exists y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\quad\\forall x\\exists y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\\coloneqq\\{&amp;\\forall x\\,\\neg(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\,((\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z))\\to \\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(x)=\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\to\\exists z\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(z)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(z)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y))),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\exists y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\quad\\forall x\\exists y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)&lt;\\operatorname{lit}(y))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Example 1.4.1 用非严格序；本节点改用严格序，互译为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x&lt;y\\leftrightarrow(x\\leq y\\land x\\ne y)\">\\(x&lt;y\\leftrightarrow(x\\leq y\\land x\\ne y)\\)</span>。非空结构约定保证模型非空；有理数的通常严格序提供一致性见证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbols]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"058f3c1c00535492","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"c40994941c97c4da","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"令 $r=(2,0)$ 为二元关系符号。$n\\in\\omega$ 是符号族的指标；在 $L_{<}$ 定义后，$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L_{<}}$ 是次序原子式的两个项输入，项的定义见 [[17-df-term]]。显示 $t<u$ 的展开式在 Assertion 给出。固定变量及逻辑符号 $\\mathsf V,\\mathsf G$ 见 [[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"058f3c1c00535492","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"令 $r=(2,0)$ 为二元关系符号。$n\\in\\omega$ 是符号族的指标；在 $L_{<}$ 定义后，$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L_{<}}$ 是次序原子式的两个项输入，项的定义见 [[17-df-term]]。显示 $t<u$ 的展开式在 Assertion 给出。固定变量及逻辑符号 $\\mathsf V,\\mathsf G$ 见 [[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-symbols","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5325f08c84582","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_{<}$ 是只有一个二元关系符号 $<$、无函数和常元的语言。$x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2$ 是三个固定语言变量；$<$ 是对象语言符号，以下 $T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 是句子集。其余连接词见 [[17-df-symbols]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"r=(2,0)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"L_{<}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{L_{<}}","display":false},{"tex":"t<u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V,\\mathsf G","display":false},{"tex":"L_{<}","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nF_n&:=\\varnothing\\quad(n\\in\\omega),\\qquad\nR_n:=\\begin{cases}\\{r\\},&n=2,\\\\\\varnothing,&n\\neq2,\\end{cases}\\quad(n\\in\\omega)\\\\\nL_{<}&:=\\langle\\mathsf V,\\varnothing,(F_n)_{n\\in\\omega},(R_n)_{n\\in\\omega},\\mathsf G\\rangle,\\\\\n(t<u)&:=r(t,u).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nT_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\\coloneqq\\{&\\forall x\\,\\neg(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\,((\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(y)<\\operatorname{lit}(z))\\to \\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(z)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(x)=\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\lor \\operatorname{lit}(y)<\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\forall y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(y)\\to\\exists z\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(z)\\land \\operatorname{lit}(z)<\\operatorname{lit}(y))),\\\\\n&\\forall x\\exists y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(y)<\\operatorname{lit}(x)),\\quad\\forall x\\exists y\\,(\\operatorname{lit}(x)<\\operatorname{lit}(y))\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x<y\\leftrightarrow(x\\leq y\\land x\\ne y)","display":false}],"bytes":2662,"backlinks":[{"id":"caf79552cf044fde","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 见 [[17-df-dense-linear-order]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]，解释语言为 $L_{<}$。"},{"id":"b6a74bb426d5caa0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_{<}$ 为 [[17-df-dense-linear-order]] 中只有二元关系符号 $<$ 的语言，$x=v_0,y=v_1,z=v_2$ 为固定语言变量。\n以下定义 $L_{<}$ 句子集 $T_{\\mathrm{LO}}$；逻辑连接词沿用该节点的一阶缩写。"},{"id":"e06453cde5ebbf0f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=L_{<}$，$T_{\\mathrm{LO}}$ 与 $T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 分别见 [[17-df-linear-order-theory]]、[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]，均采用严格序。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n量词消去见 [[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]；与模型完备化的联系见 [[17-thm-model-completion-qe]]。"},{"id":"cbf4219cf8e62a0e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_{<}$ 和 $T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 见 [[17-df-dense-linear-order]]；$\\operatorname{QE}_{L_{<}}$ 见 [[17-df-quantifier-elimination]]，允许无用自由变量；$\\mathrm{FreeVar}$、$\\mathrm{QFForm}$ 及 $\\equiv_T$ 见 [[17-df-free-variable]]、[[17-df-quantifier-free-formula]]、[[17-df-formula-consequence]]。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-el